{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"agent_message","text":"The checkout path now uses a non-authoritative analytics value, causing the annual plan to be charged at 1% of its correct production price.\n\nReview comment:\n\n- [P1] Use the authoritative price for checkout charges — /private/var/folders/xg/zvk2hrzx57s65nj22g15z1900000gn/T/native-review-feasibility-execution-c38vyl6z/runs/R02/repo/price.go:24-24\n  When `ChargeOrder` processes `annual-plan`, this now sends 100 cents to the irreversible external charger instead of the authoritative 10,000 cents. The added production metadata explicitly marks analytics pricing as non-authoritative and potentially 24 hours stale, so using `AnalyticsPrice` here causes incorrect customer charges."}}
